    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1821-a1">

                <pb facs="1189" n="1073" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg1073"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">King Ferdinand to President Wilson.</hi>
                </head>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Very Dear and Great Friend</hi>: I fulfill a very
                    painful duty in announcing to you the cruel loss which Roumania has just
                    experienced in the person of its venerated Sovereign, His Majesty King Carol I,
                    my beloved Uncle, who expired at Pelesh Castle on Saturday October 10th last.
                    The good relations which have always existed between our two countries gives me
                    the assurance that you will share the profound sorrow into which this sad event
                    plunges me and the whole of the Roumanian people.</p>
                <p>Called by the order of succession to the throne of Roumania, I inform you that I
                    have taken the constitutional oath and ask you to be assured that all my efforts
                    will tend to the cultivation of the good relations that exist between the United
                    States of America and Roumania. I seize with eagerness this circumstance to
                    offer to you, Mr. President, the expression of the sentiments of sincere esteem
                    and of high consideration with which I am,</p>
                <p>Very dear and great friend,</p>
                <p>Your Good Friend,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ferdinand</hi></signed>. <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"><placeName type="city"
                                    >Bucharest</placeName>
                                <placeName type="venue">Palace</placeName></hi></placeName>, <lb/>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1914-10-17"><hi rendition="#italic">This 17
                                October, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">E. Porumbaro</hi></signed>. </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
